{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53119","headline":"游南鴈诗 · 李臯","name":"游南鴈诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鴈荡诸奇不可穷，石梁华表远淩空。\n乾坤谁道洞中小，日月曾从牖里通。\n词客墨苔观照耀，飞仙环佩听玲珑。\n何当偕得缑山鹤，驾入嶙峋翠几重。\n（见同治丙寅刊齐召南纂《温州府志》）（按：张靖龙云：「见清周喟《南雁荡山志》卷七《诗外编》引明人陈玭《嘉靖南雁荡志》，又见乾隆《平阳县志》卷二，题作《游横阳雁荡山诗》。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李臯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53119.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53119","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}